# Project rules (nav only)

**Always-on sources**

1. [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) — stack, commands, safety, tenant, DB, checks, token discipline
2. [`analysis-before-code.mdc`](./analysis-before-code.mdc) — hard gates; full flow in skill below
3. [`best-practice-not-patches.mdc`](./best-practice-not-patches.mdc) — best-practice end-state only; never lead with补丁/workaround options
4. [`redundancy-cleanup-before-uat.mdc`](./redundancy-cleanup-before-uat.mdc) — after implement, **before UAT**: clear confirmed redundancy on the task surface
5. [`uat-before-delivery.mdc`](./uat-before-delivery.mdc) — functional changes need localhost product UAT pass before commit/merge/done
6. [`lint-build-before-commit.mdc`](./lint-build-before-commit.mdc) — Cursor mirror; **canonical** commit/push gates = [`scripts/agent-gates/README.md`](../../scripts/agent-gates/README.md) + `AGENTS.md` Checks（Claude/Codex 共用 `gate.sh`）
7. [`no-polling-except-fallback.mdc`](./no-polling-except-fallback.mdc) — no API polling except realtime fallback
8. [`git-local-merge-push.mdc`](./git-local-merge-push.mdc) — local branch → merge → push; no auto PR / agent merge-main
9. [`on-prem-pack.mdc`](./on-prem-pack.mdc) — pack/upgrade: Realtime ensure + BuildKit npm cache in artifact; **local `npm run build -w @mesa/web` before pack** when web sources change (store builds the image; lint/UAT ≠ Docker typecheck)
10. [`dev-port-isolation.mdc`](./dev-port-isolation.mdc) — `:3000` = local `main` only; feature/worktree UAT → `3002+` + `MESA_UAT_BASE`; never kill occupants
11. [`local-dev-services.mdc`](./local-dev-services.mdc) — keep stack during UAT; **after merge/land stop this-thread listen ports**; never auto-restart after Will stops it; never wipe local DB or kill other sessions’ agents
12. [`evidence-based-conclusions.mdc`](./evidence-based-conclusions.mdc) — no speculative root causes; conclusions need checkable evidence

**Skills (read when task matches `description`)**

- `.cursor/skills/mesa-analyze-before-code/SKILL.md` — analyze-first, end-state, reuse, one-representation gate
- `.cursor/skills/mesa-local-product-test/SKILL.md` — localhost product verification

**On-demand rules** (not alwaysApply): `push-verification.mdc`, `release-and-ci.mdc`, `local-product-testing.mdc` (incl. no checklist skip unless truly blocked) — when push/ship/test phrases appear.

No third root “强制规则” markdown. Product truth under `docs/`.

